{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing `clj` prelude depends on the Clojure lowerer. I’ll move the guest definitions into a shared emitter so bundled and linked Clojure can use the same runtime without introducing a dependency cycle."}}
